# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `make test_*` (debug/reldebug builds).
#
# ONNX Runtime leaks a small fixed allocation from its own static
# initialization that no extension code can reach or free: the stack is
# entirely inside libonnxruntime, below any tabfm frame. It is constant-size
# (14 bytes, 1 allocation) and does not grow with the number of sessions, so
# it cannot mask a real leak in this extension's session lifecycle.
#
# Scope deliberately narrow: only allocations whose stack names the ORT
# library. A leak in tabfm code still fails the run, which is the point.
leak:libonnxruntime
